            "how old are you age years yourself respondent",
            "date birth born year month day"
          ],
          "why_rejected": "search_variables with these phrases returned low_confidence results; no variable could be identified in the questionnaire system for current participant age or date of birth at enrollment.",
          "exposes_the_estimate_to": "Confounding bias from unmeasured age, a critical predictor of both NSAID use (age-related arthritis and pain indications) and reflux risk (age-related gastroesophageal changes)."
        }
      ],
